      "description": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A thin older man in faded star-patterned robes, a brass astrolabe hanging from his neck, ink-stained fingers clutching a notebook. His face is gaunt and worried.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Lx5HaECp18HEyusD\">\n<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.edGXn37wYpivMJIH]{17. Spore-Dawn}.</strong> The King's astrologer, dead in the hunting blind. The notebook records that \"thunder made it shudder\" (DC 38 Society or Occultism); the satchel holds 2,500 gp and a major healing potion.</p>\n</section>",
